{"category": "Added", "changelog_entry": "Enabled users to add custom LLM providers without modifying the upstream project by introducing a plugin system for registering providers via Python entry points.", "summary": "Custom LLM providers can now be added to AI Changelog Generator without modifying the upstream project. This is achieved through a plugin system, where providers are registered via Python entry points under the `ai_changelog.litellm_providers` group. Registration is idempotent and failures to load a provider are logged as warnings, preventing broken plugins from blocking startup. Users can create custom handlers and register them in their package's `pyproject.toml` to route model calls through their own backend.", "version": 1}
